    </div><div class="section-20">
      <div class="container-1280">
        <div class="title-left-side-wrapper expertise equipes">
          <div class="border-gradient-div expertise"></div>
          <h2 class="title30px no-marg">Frequently asked questions:&nbsp;</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions">
          <div id="w-node-_2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d2003207-80989674" data-w-id="2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d2003207" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">1. Does the coin dispenser need to be connected to a cash register?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions"><strong>Yes, absolutely.</strong> The Innovorder automatic coin dispenser accepts cash, calculates the change to be given, and secures the funds collected. It is directly connected to the Innovorder cash register, which transmits the amount of each transaction to it. Works exclusively with the Innovorder cash register.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d2003211-80989674" data-w-id="2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d2003211" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">2. Why equip your restaurant with an automatic coin machine?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Using an automatic coin machine in your restaurant has many advantages:<br><br> - increased fluidity at the point of sale,<br>- time savings on cash transactions,<br>- no more calculation errors,<br>- reduced risk of fraud,<br>- secure cash payments,<br>- reduction in theft (internal and external), fraud, and assaults,<br>- improved employee hygiene (no contact with currency).<br><br>Synchronized with a cash register, the coin dispenser allows merchants to be instantly up to date with each transaction.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d200321b-80989674" data-w-id="2846a31d-bf8a-0770-b1bf-4fd8d200321b" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">3. Where can I find an automatic coin machine?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Whether you are looking for a new or used coin acceptor, there are several options available to you. But be careful: if you try to buy a cheap coin acceptor or go for the easy option with a non-specialist retailer, you may end up with problems down the line (no support or after-sales service, maintenance costs, etc.). That's why we recommend contacting professionals such as Innovorder directly to find the automatic coin acceptor that best suits your needs.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_9f2f5139-742f-522f-eb7c-02eacd63d13a-80989674" data-w-id="9f2f5139-742f-522f-eb7c-02eacd63d13a" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">4. Is Innovorder suitable for my restaurant?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Regardless of the size of your establishment or organization, Innovorder is designed for both fast food and commercial catering (independent, franchise, food court, dark kitchen, bakery, etc.) as well as institutional catering (SRC, self-managed).<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_5ade3a41-4c9a-cb92-7fed-3a81da8ea906-80989674" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">5. What is included in the price?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">No unpleasant surprises!<br><br>Our turnkey solution includes: hardware, license, installation, maintenance, unlimited updates and regular follow-up by a dedicated account manager.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-fdcb66ed-b2d0-04c5-3296-72341951fe6b-80989674" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">6. Is Innovorder synchronized with my favorite applications?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Innovorder interfaces with the most popular applications used by restaurants and bakeries: Uber Eats, Hey Pongo, Splio, Stripe, Combo, Stuart, Pennylane, etc. And to offer you an ever-richer selection, we are constantly expanding our catalog of integrations.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-f920e0fb-7df0-b970-8a08-28bf7080fb67-80989674" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">7. When does NF 525 certification become mandatory for restaurants?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">NF 525 certification will be mandatory from September 1, 2026, for all restaurant owners using a cash register system. This is a legal requirement aimed at combating tax fraud.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_92e6bd6a-285e-44ac-0b42-fe2960807870-80989674" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">8. Are all Innovorder cash registers NF 525 certified?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, Innovorder's cash register software has been NF 525 certified since 2016. This guarantees that it complies with all legal requirements regarding security, archiving, and the integrity of cash register data. You are therefore fully compliant.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_7e40f5dd-fa51-6b51-78c0-0149e9d867fd-80989674" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions">
            <div class="accordion-trigger">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">9. What risks does a restaurant owner face in the event of an inspection without an NF 525-certified cash register?</h3>
              <div class="gradient-arrow-faq-solution"><img alt loading="lazy" src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/63f501f2fcfc5914c619ff0c_arrow-blog.png" class="arrow-icon---solution"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Using a non-certified cash register after the law comes into effect may result in fines, non-compliance, or even tax penalties in the event of an audit. We advise you to plan ahead and adopt a compliant solution today to avoid any unnecessary risk.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
